Take aim for 1 turn, preparing a deadly shot. During the next turn, this talent will be replaced with the ability to fire a lethal shot dealing [250%, 283%, 309%, 330%, 350% (TL1-5)] damage and marking the target.

While aiming, your intense focus causes you to shrug off [35%, 48%, 55%, 61%, 65% (TL1-5)] incoming damage and all negative effects.

This requires a bow to use.
